6-07-06","created":"2026-07-10","description":"Photo: Courtesy Mike Crapo's Office If someone opened a box 250 years from now, what would tell the story of Idaho? State leaders hope it’s a patriotic mascot, a cutting-edge computer chip, tribal artifacts, and a symbol of Idaho’s role in nuclear energy. As part of America’s 250th anniversary celebration, a time capsule has now […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},